    show Bus_Home with dissolve
    narNvl "Lethargy"
    narNvl "It consumed every bone in her body"
    narNvl "The cushion comforted her lightly"
    narNvl "Yet, still, the pain in her body prevailed"
    nvl clear
    narNvl "Her eyes were open, yet she saw nothing"
    narNvl "The cold-conditioned winds kissed her skin, yet she felt nothing"
    narNvl "She tried desperately to look for comfort, yet she found nothing"
    narNvl "She stared into something and nothing, all at once"
    nvl clear
    narNvl "Every breath was bated by exhaustion"
    narNvl "Every movement congeals her position, bit by bit"
    narNvl "Every murmur felt like the spear of Spartans down her ears"
    narNvl "Every touch of light burned the skin of her corneas"
    nvl clear
    narNvl "She was fighting a battle she couldn't win"
    narNvl "As much as she could try, as desperate as she was"
    narNvl "No amount of will could ever drag her into slumber"
    narNvl "Knowingly in vein, she closed her eyes for a moment"
    nvl clear
    scene Old_School with dissolve
    narNvl "The tranquil breeze of the midday weather..."
    narNvl "The soothing chatter of children in the playground..."
    narNvl "The vibrant verdance of Mother nature who embraced every corner of the eye..."
    narNvl "...The last moment she felt any sense of peace"
    nvl clear
    narNvl "Whatever happened to satisfaction?..."
    narNvl "Whatever happened to exhiliration?..."
    narNvl "When was the last time she enjoyed the warmth of the sun?..."
    narNvl "When was the last time she saw those she loved?... "
    nvl clear
    scene Home_Night with dissolve
    narNvl "She used to favor the night for its sunless stillness"
    narNvl "It always made her treasure the world and all of the evils it holds"
    narNvl "She walks to the front door. The same one that greets her with a solemn smile at the end of every night"
    narNvl "And she felt nothing..."
    nvl clear
    scene Room_Night with dissolve
    narNvl "Begrudgingly, she took a bath..."
    narNvl "The weight on her skin was relieved, but that one of her heart lingered deeply"
    narNvl "Hot water...cold water...warm water"
    narNvl "She turned the knob in many directions, and found her chest weighing the same..."
    nvl clear
    scene Night_Kitchen with dissolve
    narNvl "She soon dried her hair, then indolently scraps something to eat..."
    narNvl "Powderized drinks with caffiene riddled her cupboards"
    narNvl "The cabinets smelled like insect excrement; the only thing that filled the empty shelves..."
    narNvl "The stovetop was clean as crystal, just like the day it was bought..."
    nvl clear
    narNvl "Some old stale bread was lying on the empty tabletop..."
    narNvl "Leftovers from a night unknown sat deserted in the fridge..."
    narNvl "A singular plastic cup with dried saliva sat next to the sink..."
    narNvl "...good enough..."
    nvl clear
