    scene empty with dissolve

    un "UWAA!"
    n "Her stomach nearly jumped out of her mouth"
    n "Though microseconds have passed, her head embraced a severe stinging pain"
    n "Numbed only by her dimensions twisting and tumbling to their own will"
    n "The first second: nuzzled by whatever slight comfort she could. The second: a hard surface under her back"
    n "Every breath felt like stones continually added to a pouch"
    n "Shrouded in darkness, yet she discerned her plane became compact"
    n "A vibration within her begins"
    n "She couldn't stop it"
    n "Like rabid ferrets like a sealed pouch, her chest pounded and scratched outwards, all the while the void consumes her"
