    n "Closed eyes: darkness, Opened eyes: a cold vaccum"
    n "For a moment she considered her knackered mind might've taken her into their gnarled custody"
    n "That moment didn't last a second, as each one that followed after it did nothing but add fuel to the fire that tortured the rat inside of her chest"
