    scene flashbang with flashbang
    un "WOA-!"
    n "The crack of light blinded her like the blaze of the sun, while the foundation of her back dematerizalized"
    n "A mighty force pushed the entirety of her person outward, into the light, and the new-born winds pierced her skin like paper"
    n "Quickly the world settled down once more..."
    scene Mirror_Chamber with intro_dissolve

    n "The light faded between the lines of the darkness"
    n "She once was asleep in her room...on the sharpest edges of desperation. And now, she was here..."
    n "Coffins of ornate detail in glimmering gold danced like joyful phantoms above her...Her foot caressed the soft carpet, adorned with florid squiggles of every cold color..."
    n "Directly above her, like a guillotine's blade, was a candelabrum composed of hanging chains of metallic surfaces of multiple kinds..."
    n "Its tentacle arms streched outward gallantly, like a butler, bowing courteously, reaching out a silver platter for its master..."
    n "The platter was of rustic darkness, creaking and exuberating its years of service. The platter itself was a flower that tucked a small beam of light inside it..."
    n "Peculiar shadows cast upon the wicked light of the chandelier"

